        <h2>Rowing</h2>

        <p>
            Rowing has become my favourite sport since I started it in Year 10.
            When I first started, I struggled with some parts of the sport and
            wasn't very strong at pulling watts. However, through training and
            practice, I gradually improved. Rowing was one of the things that 
            help me go through stress. There were a lot of regattas for the rowing
            season. However, the best regatta out af all of them has to be the MAADI Cup
            where it takes place at Christchurch. It was both insane and fun. Although, we 
            were not able to achieve a medal but it was still lots of fun having this opportunity
            to hang out with my friends, row against other schools, and best of all, a week away from 
            my siblings. I was pretty sad about leaving where I had to face the faces of my annoying 
            siblings. 
        </p>
